{"file": "荒岛我为王，女神靠边站-第73集.mp4", "ep": 73, "duration": 59.8, "segments": [{"start": 0.21, "end": 2.21, "text": "昨晚那肉味飘了一夜"}, {"start": 2.21, "end": 3.21, "text": "我做梦都在啃"}, {"start": 3.21, "end": 4.21, "text": "啃着了吗"}, {"start": 4.21, "end": 5.21, "text": "没有"}, {"start": 5.21, "end": 6.21, "text": "醒了就没了"}, {"start": 7.21, "end": 8.21, "text": "蛇咬人可不管你是谁"}, {"start": 8.21, "end": 15.96, "text": "是竹叶晴"}, {"start": 15.96, "end": 16.96, "text": "大家先别动"}, {"start": 16.96, "end": 17.96, "text": "不然她受惊"}, {"start": 17.96, "end": 18.96, "text": "咬到小门就糟了"}, {"start": 18.96, "end": 19.96, "text": "姜老师"}, {"start": 19.96, "end": 20.96, "text": "你有办法吗"}, {"start": 20.96, "end": 21.96, "text": "一上"}, {"start": 21.96, "end": 22.96, "text": "从侧后方绕过去"}, {"start": 22.96, "end": 23.96, "text": "棍子拆到清蛇和腿中间"}, {"start": 23.96, "end": 24.96, "text": "往上挑"}, {"start": 24.96, "end": 26.96, "text": "要快 要稳"}, {"start": 26.96, "end": 27.96, "text": "手别抖"}, {"start": 27.96, "end": 28.96, "text": "我 我不行的"}, {"start": 28.96, "end": 29.96, "text": "你行"}, {"start": 29.96, "end": 30.96, "text": "数三下就动手"}, {"start": 31.96, "end": 32.96, "text": "二"}, {"start": 32.96, "end": 46.28, "text": "夏时宁"}, {"start": 46.28, "end": 47.28, "text": "你太厉害了"}, {"start": 47.28, "end": 48.31, "text": "以后呢"}, {"start": 48.31, "end": 49.31, "text": "以后"}, {"start": 49.31, "end": 50.31, "text": "别把蛇往银地编上去"}, {"start": 50.31, "end": 52.31, "text": "蛇可不认什么银地"}, {"start": 52.31, "end": 54.31, "text": "她认的是柴队里的老鼠"}, {"start": 54.31, "end": 56.53, "text": "盐送到了"}, {"start": 56.53, "end": 57.53, "text": "一咽一下"}]}